{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big选X：X的大块直接交代人物处境、原因和心理转折，连续扫下来能还原完整脉络；Y的大字多是从句子中抽出的短语，单看时容易缺少因果和转折关系。small选Y：Y的小字更善于补充旧日亲近、委屈和当下反应之间的联系，例如“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”，比X部分相对独立的感官比喻更有解释作用；core判平：两版都完整呈现了怀念归属与坚持不再忍让之间的反复拉扯。concise选X：Y的小字多次复述大字已经表达的委屈、想念和不安；human选X：Y有“活动感像暂时侧身离开沉重的问题”“心里的愿望向远方发出”等生硬或偏书面的搭配；fine选X：X的感受主要落在观众的身体反应和具体情境上，Y则有不少内容转去描述和弦、旋律、节奏本身。load选Y：Y的大字虽然数量较多，但每块较短、意群边界清楚，各屏停留时间足以扫读；X的大块多为较长的完整句子，尤其S06、S13，阅读负担更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "17a1956d-8364-4e8c-9573-ddb11df4d78e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T194735375359Z", "elapsed_seconds": 261.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:51:56.399014+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "00f191752ef583b89530ff6abbedc5bc31787e26b80f0644f4670d3772b3338b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4